# hwid_win

Goal: match QQ Music Windows client HWID (disk + net) for MMKV key material.

## HDD (`hdd/`)

Ref: WinSim DiskId32 (`diskid32.cpp`), rewritten in C.

| file | DiskId32 origin |
|------|-----------------|
| `hdd1_read_with_admin.c` | `ReadPhysicalDriveInNTWithAdminRights` |
| `hdd3_read_without_admin.c` | `ReadPhysicalDriveInNTWithZeroRights` |

DiskId32 is freeware, unwarranted; no SPDX on original. See `hdd/README.md`.

## Net (`net/`)

From QQ Music client RE; no public upstream.

| file | role |
|------|------|
| `ethernet_id.c` | first ethernet/Wi-Fi MAC |
| `netbios_id.c` | `NetWkstaTransportEnum` path |

See `net/README.md`. Prefer behavior parity over cleanup that changes IDs.
